The reference-station records redistributed under data/reference/ are
government reference data obtained from the Environmental Research Group of
Imperial College London, using data from the London Air Quality Network
(LAQN). That information is licensed under the terms of the Open Government
Licence v2.0 (https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/2/);
please credit ERG / LAQN as described in the README when reusing it.
